<title>UK: TBI sells industrial estates for 9.8 mln stg.</title>
<headline>TBI sells industrial estates for 9.8 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property and airports company TBI Plc said on Monday it had exchanged contracts with various investment groups for the sale of four industrial estates in England and Wales.</p>
<p>It said it had received aggregate consideration for the four properties of 9.8 million stg to give a net profit on the sale of 1.25 million.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
